    <briefdescription>
<para>Out of bounds access error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1OutOfBoundsError" kindref="compound">OutOfBoundsError</ref> represents an error when an index or position is outside the valid range.</para>
